# `scripts/trial_head.sh` drives the whole pipeline at a few hundred steps
# and ONE GIFT-Eval config. Its score is a wiring check, not a measurement,
# and a `score_k16_bb400_h200_student.txt` beside the study's own score files
# is one glob away from being read as a study number.
#
# `trial.log` is the exception, and it is committed: it carries the run
# record and both tables verbatim, which is the evidence that the head half
# of this pipeline ran before phase 1 spent its first hours of backbone time.
results/trial/*
!results/trial/trial.log
